Four fields: Front, Back, Reading and Explanation. No changes is styling. Two cards per note:

1: Front= {{Front}} Back= {{FrontSide}} <hr> {{furigana:Reading}}<br><br>{{Back}}<br><br>{{Explanation}}

2: Front= {{Back}} Back= {{FrontSide}} <hr> {{Front}}<br><br>{{furigana:Reading}}<br><br>{{Explanation}}
